From fdee910fb7714ed3f8fd83b670b2618df26840a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregory Price <gourry@gourry.net>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 07:13:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] selftests/dax: carry the generic tiering perf tooling

Same microbench / latency-probe / collect_stats / dcperf tooling as base_nodes,
so every branch in the matrix has an identical perf+analysis environment
regardless of which feature layer is under test.
